      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.8,
      "end_seconds": 64.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.45,
      "end_seconds": 91.44,
      "duration_seconds": 25.99,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get pain around my period as well the pain around my period? That's been for two weeks as for pain around my period, honestly, all the time as for pain low in the pelvis, I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the month before"
