      "start_seconds": 265.44,
      "end_seconds": 276.51,
      "duration_seconds": 11.07,
      "text": "It's valsartan, 80 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure. Well, it's mefenamic acid, 500 milligrams, when it hurts."
